# Development workflow

## Commands
- `bun run dev` starts the development server on `localhost:3030`.
- `bun run build` bundles the client and prerenders into `dist`.
- `bun run check` runs Biome with fixes. `bun run format` only formats.
- `bun run stats` refreshes `src/data/stats.json` and needs `GH_TOKEN`.

## Before committing
- `bun run check`, `bunx tsc --noEmit` and `bun run build` all pass.
- A change to anything visible is checked in the built page, in the dark and light themes, at desktop and phone widths.

## Deploys
- Every push to `main` deploys to production over FTP and replaces the remote folder. A daily scheduled run rebuilds with fresh stats.
- The workflow holds only the repository's read-only token. Never add a personal token as a secret. Totals that include private repositories are refreshed locally and committed.
